Day 49 - EC2 High CPU Investigation
Objective
Investigate a slow EC2 instance caused by high CPU utilization.

Environment
Amazon Linux 2023
t2.micro
SSH access enabled
Investigation Steps
Connected to EC2
Generated CPU load using stress
Monitored CPU usage
Identified the top CPU-consuming process
Stopped the process
Verified system recovery
Commands Used
top
uptime
free -m
ps aux --sort=-%cpu | head
stress --cpu 2 --timeout 300
pkill stress
